# Endpoint Domain Rules

When editing `packages/endpoint-domain`, **MUST** follow [packages/endpoint-domain/docs/DESIGN-CONVENTIONS.md](packages/endpoint-domain/docs/DESIGN-CONVENTIONS.md).

**Non-negotiable:**
- No raw string literals for paths, URLs, methods, headers — use constants + branded types
- Paths: nested by domain, full path at every leaf, version in path (`/api/v1/...`)
- REST paths in `cloudflare.ts`; DO paths in `cloudflare-do.ts` (separate file)
- Types: `ApiPath`, `DOPath`, `EndpointId` from `types/brands.ts`

Violations block merge.
